  "disclosure": "I authored the retained exact-run binding peer debed9c66. That role is lineage/provenance only, not an independent re-review of itself or an independent behavioral observation. The distinct actual78 evidence peer0b116f34 was authored by Archive and is explicitly retained.",
  "findings": [
    "The filer imports only standard Node assertion/filesystem/path/hash/gzip facilities. It never imports, evaluates, launches or executes application, test, captured program, reader or collector source. Safe fixed input reads and exclusive new-stage output writes remain inside the workspace work-only destination; no active repository write, Git mutation, network action or deletion exists.",
    "Every31 literal source role is SHA256/size-bound and matches the frozen input authority. Reads reject symlink path components and remain bounded at16MiB; uploaded evidence reads remain8MiB. Exact run/job/head/artifact, single completed Windows hosted job, artifact digest/size, commit/tree and untruncated tree are rechecked as preserved data before writing.",
    "All78 exact uploaded members are recoverable from the immutable original outer ZIP and its identical portable inner ZIP. The70 known source aliases plus8 direct nonsource artifact names partition that set exactly. I independently CRC/hash/read every member, matched the fixed source table and report file table, and checked names/header bytes for acquired program carriers. The filer preserves both ZIPs and does not substitute a later attempt.",
    "The fixed source70 table is checked against the actual captured Git tree with mode,size and computed Git blob identity. Same-attempt before/after receipts, source stability, sourceCommit, execution fields, overlay=false and exact source-before digest remain required separately from product observation acceptance.",
    "The actual5 raw TAP names and ordered results/summary must match the frozen unchanged selected checks. Workflow outcomes, raw stdout/stderr and two exact worker traces remain bound. Six successful native callbacks, zero error fields, unchanged15s/64MiB options, original script pin, worker filenames/PIDs/sequences and elapsed values are retained without projecting or rewriting clocks.",
    "Raw APIs/logs, tree/commit, both template generations, exact binding lineage, source peers and immutable D24 failure context are retained as content-addressed bytes; large non-ZIP context is gzip-retained with bounded decode/readback, while exact ZIPs remain identity bytes. Output object deduplication preserves distinct logical roles and exclusive writes/readback reject collisions.",
    "The README and manifest distinguish instrumented5/5 and6 callbacks from the older1098/1100 failure. They explicitly preserve unknown retrospective cause, observer overhead and original clocks. No full-suite rerun, uninstrumented performance, reliability fix, deadline extension, retry, parity or superiority is claimed.",
    "Public inputs are limited to the declared repository/source/backup context and synthetic test evidence. The fixed78 members contain no acquired EXE/DLL/PDB program carrier, and credential-shaped strings were not found in these inputs. This is a bounded review of the fixed capsule, not a universal privacy/security assertion.",
    "The filer itself remains unexecuted during this source peer. After authorized backup-only execution, Archive must independently audit generated roles/decoded hashes/fullZIP bytes/readability and root must review/copy the exact output authority; no generated file count or success capsule is invented in advance."
